[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Shopping Made Easy]
[00:01.62]Who was the thief? | 谁是小偷？
[00:13.72]People are not so honest as | 人们不像从前那样诚实，
[00:16.89]they once were. | 曾经是那样。
[00:18.40]The temptation to steal is greater than | 偷窃的诱惑比以往任何时候都
[00:22.13]ever before--especially in large shops. | 更大——尤其是在大型商店里。
[00:26.60]A detective recently watched a well-dressed | 一名侦探最近发现一名穿着考究的
[00:30.19]woman who always went into a large store | 妇女，她总是周一上午
[00:33.67]on Monday mornings. | 去一家大商店。
[00:35.43]One Monday, | 有一个周一，
[00:37.22]there were fewer people in the shop | 商店里的人比平时
[00:39.68]than usual when the woman came in, | 少，当时那个妇女进来了，
[00:43.09]so it was easier for the detective to watch her. | 因此侦探更容易监视她。
[00:48.10]The woman first bought a few small articles. | 这名妇女首先买了几件小商品。
[00:52.64]After a little time, | 过了一会儿，
[00:54.75]she chose one of the most expensive dresses | 她选择了一件店里最昂贵的
[00:58.62]in the shop and handed it to an assistant | 连衣裙，并把它递给了一名店员，
[01:02.12]who wrapped it up for her as quickly as possible. | 店员尽快地为她包好了。
[01:06.68]Then the woman simply took the parcel | 然后，这名妇女只是拿起包裹
[01:10.82]and walked out of the shop without paying. | 没有付钱就走出了商店。
[01:14.75]When she was arrested, | 当她被捕时，
[01:17.27]the detective found out that | 侦探发现
[01:19.54]the shop assistant was her daughter. | 这名店员是她的女儿。
[01:22.60]The girl 'gave' her mother | 这女孩每周“送给”她母亲
[01:25.22]a free dress once a week! | 一件免费连衣裙！